      "post_id": "2086573795377054139",
      "url": "https://x.com/General_Oluchi/status/2086573795377054139",
      "text": "I gathered shipping quotes from 3 international shipping companies in Nigeria and here’s what I found. For parcels from Lagos to the US:\n\n- Parcel Service (UPS, FedEx) 5-7 business days: N26,000 - N25,000 per kg, minimum of 10 kg.\n\n- Air Cargo (2-4 weeks): N14,000 - N17,000 per kg, minimum of 10kg.\n\nI order things from Temu and Aliexpress, based in China and have never paid more than $10 for shipping even with tariffs. \n\nWhat is going on???!!!",
      "original_text": "I gathered shipping quotes from 3 international shipping companies in Nigeria and here’s what I found. For parcels from Lagos to the US:\n\n- Parcel Service (UPS, FedEx) 5-7 business days: N26,000 - N25,000 per kg, minimum of 10 kg.\n\n- Air Cargo (2-4 weeks): N14,000 - N17,000 per kg, minimum of 10kg.\n\nI order things from Temu and Aliexpress, based in China and have never paid more than $10 for shipping even with tariffs. \n\nWhat is going on???!!!",
      "links": [],
      "translation_zh": "我从尼日利亚的 3 家国际运输公司收集了运费报价，以下是我的发现。对于从拉各斯寄往美国的包裹：\n\n- 包裹服务（UPS、FedEx）5-7 个工作日：每 kg N26,000 - N25,000，最低 10 kg。\n\n- 空运货物（2-4 周）：每 kg N14,000 - N17,000，最低 10kg。\n\n我从中国的 Temu 和 Aliexpress 买东西，即使有关税，运费也从来没有超过 $10。\n\n这到底是怎么回事???!!!",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "summary_zh": "用户讨论物流、配送或包裹追踪体验。",
