      "url": "https://x.com/_GirlMaher_/status/2086581914325188668",
      "text": "I decided to order stuff for myself, and here's the report after three orders:\n\n- Walmart papasan chair: Cushion missing (opened ticket)\n- Temu device: Not functional (requested return/refund now must find printer for retunr slip)\n- Amazon order for blender + projector: Marked as delivered, but no delivery found.\n\nSo I guess I must return to my previous stance on life... buy nothing.",
      "original_text": "I decided to order stuff for myself, and here's the report after three orders:\n\n- Walmart papasan chair: Cushion missing (opened ticket)\n- Temu device: Not functional (requested return/refund now must find printer for retunr slip)\n- Amazon order for blender + projector: Marked as delivered, but no delivery found.\n\nSo I guess I must return to my previous stance on life... buy nothing.",
